nkers-bypass-restrictions-with-900-million-oil/articleshow/130445313.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/is-trumps-hormuz-blockade-a-success-34-iran-linked-tankers-bypass-restrictions-with-900-million-oil/articleshow/130445313.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-22T20:47:19+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130445615,imgsize-51320.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[DWP expands face-to-face PIP assessments despite staffing shortages in UK]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130445608.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Disability benefit claimants in the UK will face more in-person assessments as the Department for Work and Pensions aims for 30% face-to-face reviews. This shift, intended to improve accuracy, is hampered by a shortage of medical staff.  Advocacy groups express concern over the burden on individuals with health issues, stressing the need for flexibility beyond physical presence.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/dwp-expands-face-to-face-pip-assessments-despite-staffing-shortages-in-uk/articleshow/130445608.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/dwp-expands-face-to-face-pip-assessments-despite-staffing-shortages-in-uk/articleshow/130445608.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-22T20:56:12+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130445729,imgsize-6518.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Indian medical student behind fake MAGA influencer 'Emily Hart' says Gemini gave him idea, 'hot girl' too generic; wants to study in US]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" styl